# act (nektos/act) default flags for local CI iteration.
#
# Usage: invoke `act` (or via tools/act-cell) from repo root; act reads
# this file automatically. See AGENTS.md §3.6 "Local CI iteration with
# act" for the operator-facing workflow.

# Runner images — `catthehacker/ubuntu:full-*` pinned for ALL runners.
#
# Why full-* rather than the smaller js-* variant: js-* installs Node.js
# via `nvm`, which puts `node` at `$NVM_DIR/versions/node/v.../bin/node`
# rather than `/usr/bin/node`. act invokes JS-based actions
# (`actions/cache@v4`, `actions/checkout@v4`) via a bare
# `docker exec cmd=[node ...]` — no shell init, so nvm never sources its
# profile and `node` is not on PATH. Result: every cache step crashes
# with `exec: "node": executable file not found in $PATH` (verified
# under push-19 act run on js-latest).
#
# full-* has apt-installed node at `/usr/bin/node` (system PATH, no
# shell init needed) plus `gh` (which `tools/momus-local` also needs,
# so one image serves both drivers). The image is ~60GB extracted but
# cached locally after first pull and shared across all act-driven
# tooling on this host.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:full-latest
-P ubuntu-22.04=catthehacker/ubuntu:full-22.04
-P ubuntu-24.04=catthehacker/ubuntu:full-24.04

# Force linux/amd64 even on Apple Silicon. Most GitHub Actions
# (setup-nim-action, actions/cache@v4) only ship amd64 binaries; arm64
# emulation via Docker Desktop's qemu is slow (3-5x) but correct.
--container-architecture linux/amd64

# Reuse containers across runs of the same job so dep installs cache.
# Combine with `--rm` on the CLI if you want a clean slate.
--reuse

# Pull images on first reference, then leave alone. Avoids re-pulling
# the ~2GB catthehacker image on every invocation.
--pull=false

# Persistent artifact/cache servers so actions/cache@v4 hits across act
# runs. Both directories live under ~/.cache/act and survive between
# invocations; the operator (or wrapper) handles cleanup. See AGENTS.md
# §3.6 "Caching" subsection.
--artifact-server-path /Users/eek/.cache/act/artifacts
--cache-server-path /Users/eek/.cache/act/cache
